\li{\strong{Mathlib} 14.54 to 14.14 s, -2.7 \%: 0.40 s, the figure of rep-P11 for the copies. The rounds: 14.51, 14.52 and 14.59 s before, 14.19, 14.11 and 14.13 s after. A window of two rounds twenty minutes earlier, with the Mathlib windows of another package between its runs, had 14.97 and 14.59 s before and 14.62 and 14.64 s after (-1.0 \%); over the five quiet rounds the pass is 0.30 s shorter.}
